<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Australia v West Indies scoreboard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Australia v West Indies scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day of the second test between Australia and West Indies at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Australia first innings 331</p>
<p>West Indies first innings (overnight 156 for three)</p>
<p> S.Campbell b Blewett			77</p>
<p> R.Samuels lbw b McGrath		   35</p>
<p> B.Lara c Healy b McGrath		   2</p>
<p> C.Hooper lbw b Warne			27</p>
<p> S.Chanderpaul c and b Warne	     48</p>
<p> J.Adams c Bevan b McGrath		 30</p>
<p> C.Browne c Blewett b McGrath	     0</p>
<p> I.Bishop c Elliott b Warne		48</p>
<p> C.Ambrose b Gillespie			9</p>
<p> K.Benjamin b Gillespie		     6</p>
<p> C.Walsh not out				2</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-6 nb-10)		   20</p>
<p> Total (117.2 overs)			304</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-92, 2-108, 3-136, 4-166, 5-229, 6-229, 7-243, 8-286, 9-298.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 31-9-82-4 (nb-9), Kasprowicz 13-2-37-0, Gillespie 23-5-62-2 (nb-1), Warne 35.2-13-65-3, Blewett 4-0-13-1, Bevan 11-0-35-0.</p>
<p>Australia second innings</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Lara b Bishop		  16</p>
<p> M.Elliott not out			   45</p>
<p> R.Ponting c Browne b Bishop		4</p>
<p> M.Waugh not out				2</p>
<p> Extras (nb-4 b-2 lb-4)		    10</p>
<p> Total (for two wickets, 30 overs)     77</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-51, 2-67.</p>
<p>To bat: M.Bevan, G.Blewett, I.Healy, S.Warne, M.Kasprowicz, J.Gillespie, G.McGrath.</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 4-0-15-0, Walsh 6-2-9-0 (nb-4), Bishop 11-2-23-2, Benjamin 1-0-3-0, Adams 3-0-16-0, Hooper 5-3-5-0.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
